+### Optional Preflight
+
+Before running document parsing or the examples, you can check local readiness
+without model calls:
+
+```bash
+python scripts/preflight_raganything.py \
+  --paths examples/sample_docs \
+  --parser mineru \
+  --output-json preflight_report.json \
+  --output-md preflight_report.md
+```
+
+The preflight checks input paths, supported file types, parser/runtime
+availability, LLM and embedding environment variables, numeric settings, and
+working/output directory writability. Use `--strict` in CI to fail on blockers.
+
